{"path":"physics/optics-modern/optics/photoelectric-saturation","title":"光电效应·饱和光电流与光强","type":"example","html":"<p>关于光电效应，下列说法正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 光的频率一定时，入射光越强，饱和光电流越大</p>\n<p>B. 饱和光电流的大小与入射光强无关</p>\n<p>C. 入射光强一定时，光的频率越高，饱和光电流越大</p>\n<p>D. 只要入射光足够强，就能发生光电效应</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=nh\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nh</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span></span></span></span>（光强=每秒光子数×单光子能量）是连接&quot;光强&quot;与&quot;饱和电流&quot;的桥梁，这在&quot;频率相同/不同、强度变化&quot;的比较题里是必用公式；</li>\n<li>频率相同但强度不同的两条 I-U 曲线：饱和电流不同、截止电压相同（遏止电压只跟频率有关）；</li>\n<li>强度相同但频率不同的两条曲线：饱和电流可能不同、截止电压不同（频率越高遏制电压越&quot;负&quot;）——对照图先画横轴 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">U</span></span></span></span>、纵轴 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">I</span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>真题关联：光电效应 I-U 图与规律辨析为新高考高频选择题。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>光电效应三大规律</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>发生条件：入射光频率 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>ν</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu\\ge\\nu_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（极限频率，由金属决定），与光强无关；</li>\n<li>饱和光电流 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：单位时间逸出的光电子数达到饱和，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由<strong>入射光的光子数</strong>决定（频率一定时，光强 ∝ 光子数）；</li>\n<li>逸出光电子的最大初动能 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{k\\max}=h\\nu-W_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只与频率有关。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>逐项判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A：频率一定 ⇒ 光强增大 ⇒ 光子数增多 ⇒ 单位时间逸出光电子多 ⇒ 饱和电流大 ✓；</li>\n<li>B：与 A 矛盾，错；</li>\n<li>C：光强一定（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=nh\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nh</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span></span></span></span>）时，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span></span></span></span> 增大则光子数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 减小，饱和电流反而可能小 ⇒ &quot;越大&quot;错；</li>\n<li>D：光强再大，只要 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>ν</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu&lt;\\nu_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就<strong>不发生</strong>光电效应——光强不决定能否发生，错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;频率定电流，光强定多少（饱和电流）；光子数是桥梁，光强=nν 要换算&quot;</strong>；\n&quot;够强就能发光电&quot;是经典的错误选项；&quot;饱和电流跟光强无关&quot;也是一眼错。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>30 秒选 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"关于光电效应，下列说法正确的是（ ） A. 光的频率一定时，入射光越强，饱和光电流越大 B. 饱和光电流的大小与入射光强无关 C. 入射光强一定时，光的频率越高，饱和光电流越大 D. 只要入射光足够强，就能发生光电效应 I = n h ν ","source":"自编（经典考法：光电效应为新高考高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"饱和电流由\"单位时间到达阴极的光电子数\"决定，而光电子数由\"光子数\"决定——频率一定时，光强∝光子数∝饱和电流；光强一定、频率改变，光子数也会变。","fit":["光电效应规律（极限频率/饱和电流）","光强与光子数的关系","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Mar 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"optics-modern","title":"光学与近代物理"},{"slug":"optics","title":"光学与近代物理"},{"slug":"photoelectric-saturation","title":"光电效应·饱和光电流与光强"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"doppler","title":"多普勒效应（靠近变高）","type":"example"},{"slug":"interference-fringes","title":"双缝干涉条纹间距","type":"example"},{"slug":"light-speed","title":"介质中的光速（v=c/n）","type":"example"},{"slug":"nuclear-decay","title":"核反应·半衰期与质能计算（衰变次数/断代/聚变）","type":"example"},{"slug":"optics-modern","title":"光学与近代物理","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"photoelectric-stop-voltage","title":"光电效应遏止电压（hν−W 心算）","type":"example"},{"slug":"refraction","title":"折射定律与全反射（特殊角组合）","type":"example"},{"slug":"total-reflection","title":"全反射临界角（sinC=1/n）","type":"example"}]}